      "text": "In the Zscaler Admin Console, the incidents that occur in your organization are displayed on the Incidents page. You can use filters to modify the incidents that are displayed on the page. Some of the filters have predefined values that you select, some of the filters require you to enter a text string value, and a couple of the filters require you to select an operator (>, ≥, <, ≤, or =) and the number of matches. The following filters have predefined values:"
