      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Select a filter and then select or enter the filter values to include or exclude on the right side of the window. As you select or enter the filter values, the number of values selected appears next to the filter. You can select multiple filters and their values. For filters with predefined values (e.g., Department and Dictionary), you can select to include or exclude all the filter values by selecting the Select All checkbox. To remove all the selected filters, click Reset.",
